OL,3,ALongest-ever UN climate talks end with 
OL,4,Ano deal as deep divisions exposed      
OL,6,FCountries have failed to reach a major 
OL,7,Fnew deal to tackle climate change after
OL,8,Fdeep divisions over fossil fuels and   
OL,9,Fmoney emerged at the UN COP31 talks in 
OL,10,FTurkey.                                
OL,12,FNegotiations were due to finish on     
OL,13,FFriday but ran late into Sunday in     
OL,14,Fsearch of common ground, becoming the  
OL,15,Flongest UN climate conference in       
OL,16,Fhistory.                               
OL,18,FBut the final deal proved unacceptable 
OL,19,Fto the EU, Pacific island nations and  
OL,20,Fothers because it failed to directly   
OL,21,Fmention fossil fuels, the main cause of
OL,22,Fglobal warming.                        
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
